= Antifaschistische Aktion

The <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span>  have formed <span style="color: #700000;">Antifaschistische</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">Aktion</span>, a mass organization for the self-defense of communities against [? if not dnef_formed: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> threat. ?][? if dnef_formed: threat of <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>. ?] Designed by <span style="color: #700000;">Max Gebhard</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">Max Keilson</span> of the <span style="color: #700000;">ARBKD</span>, its two-flag logo representing a united front.

[? if not kpd_truce : Despite the <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span>'s hostility to them, many ?][? if kpd_truce: Many ?] local activists within our party have already expresed interest in working with the mass organization

- @fund: Provide funding to Antifaschistische Aktion</span>
- @reach-out-truce: Reach out to the <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span> to coordinate our forces in the name of <span style="color: #700000;">Anti</span><span style="color: #c00000;">-</span><span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>
- @reach-out-lol: Reach out to the <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span> to coordinate our forces in the name of <span style="color: #700000;">Anti</span><span style="color: #c00000;">-</span><span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>
- @abstain: Remain silent with regards to the mass organization
- @oppose: Ban our members from engaging with this blatant front organization

@fund
