We have provided funding to <span style="color: #700000;">Antifaschistische</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">Aktion</span> in the name of a united front against <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>.

The <span style="color: #000000;">bourgeois</span> parties decry it as material support for [? if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia: a front organization for an illegal ?][? if not rfb_banned and not rfb_banned_prussia: a ?] <span style="color: #700000;">Communist</span> paramilitary [? if (reformist_strength >= 20 and not (rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia)) or (reformist_strength + center_strength >= 20 and (rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia)): , a sentiment echoed by many within our party ?]

