@abstain
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 25;

We have stayed silent on the matter, providing effective toleration to our local members' attempts to join the mass organization [? if not kpd_truce or kpd_relation < 50: attempts which have, perhaps expectedly, been met with hostility by the national <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span> ?]

@oppose
